  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With HTC Vive controllers (might be others to, can't verify) and the camera drone mode active the left touchpad movement is analog meaning you can (mostly) smoothly adjust the flying speed for left/right/forward/backward with the touch pad. This does not seem to be the case for the pan/tilt controls on the right hand. So you can't control the speed of those movements. It's either move with a fixed speed or not making it hard to do fine positioning(esp at higher zoom) and also means no smooth movement for manual tracking shots. I would really love to see these controls also becoming analog.",
